WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:19.280
[Meet Yourself]

01:20.000 --> 01:23.880
[Episode 18]

02:11.105 --> 02:13.981
♫ Do you ever feel alone ♫

02:14.005 --> 02:16.805
♫ Standing on the road ♫

02:16.805 --> 02:19.845
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

02:21.605 --> 02:24.805
♫ In the air my memories flow ♫

02:24.805 --> 02:27.245
♫ Faces in a row ♫

02:27.405 --> 02:30.981
♫ Take a long way home ♫

02:31.005 --> 02:38.105
♫ But all of these remind me to believe ♫

02:38.105 --> 02:41.585
♫ No one will stay or leave ♫

02:41.605 --> 02:48.805
♫ And then all of these remind me to receive ♫

02:48.805 --> 02:52.685
♫ The life we can see ♫

02:57.805 --> 03:02.885
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

03:08.505 --> 03:13.585
♫ It's just another day ♫

03:23.835 --> 03:26.215
Haven't seen the sunrise for years.

03:27.485 --> 03:28.765
Beautiful.

03:35.505 --> 03:36.925
What are you doing?

03:37.735 --> 03:39.275
Enjoying the sunrise.

03:44.165 --> 03:45.545
Why are you taking my photo?

03:45.545 --> 03:47.565
Aren't you recording sunrise?

03:47.955 --> 03:52.675
I am recording the man who is
watching the sunrise with me now.

03:52.675 --> 03:54.263
He's Xie Zhiyao.

03:54.485 --> 03:57.275
He's a handsome man on the way to
entrepreneurship.

03:57.275 --> 03:58.555
He's a bit poor.

03:58.645 --> 04:03.869
However... he abides by male morality.

04:04.555 --> 04:06.227
He is kind and filial.

04:06.325 --> 04:10.435
As his friend, I'm here to help him get married.

04:10.435 --> 04:11.995
No need.

04:11.995 --> 04:13.901
I want to pursue my career.

04:13.925 --> 04:16.125
You didn't say so last time.

04:16.975 --> 04:18.045
I haven't washed my face.

04:18.045 --> 04:18.875
I have gum in my eyes.

04:18.875 --> 04:19.555
Don't shoot me.

04:19.555 --> 04:20.076
That's OK.

04:20.076 --> 04:21.485
Stop.

04:21.485 --> 04:22.765
OK.

04:28.805 --> 04:33.885
♫ It's just another day ♫

05:23.845 --> 05:25.125
Hu.

05:26.365 --> 05:27.645
Hu.

05:28.755 --> 05:30.035
I have to go.

05:34.675 --> 05:35.555
No.

05:35.555 --> 05:37.035
Where are you going?

05:37.315 --> 05:39.143
To see my parents.

05:40.875 --> 05:42.195
Are you refining pills?

05:42.195 --> 05:42.846
I just woke up.

05:42.846 --> 05:43.805
I haven't cleaned up.

05:43.805 --> 05:44.046
No.

05:44.046 --> 05:45.845
Will anyone take you to the airport?

05:45.845 --> 05:48.805
Xiaochun, Why do you leave of a sudden?

05:48.805 --> 05:49.995
Don't see me off.

05:49.995 --> 05:51.605
I won't. Stop daydreaming.

05:51.605 --> 05:53.085
I'll go downstairs.

05:57.635 --> 05:58.675
Come on.

05:58.675 --> 05:59.045
Fine.

05:59.045 --> 05:59.486
I can.

05:59.486 --> 06:00.555
You're not young anymore.

06:00.555 --> 06:01.951
Let go.

06:02.925 --> 06:04.981
Damai, see you.

06:05.675 --> 06:06.955
Take care.

06:08.405 --> 06:09.525
Don't see me off.

06:09.525 --> 06:10.076
Give me.

06:10.076 --> 06:11.075
I won't see you off.

06:11.075 --> 06:12.675
I just want to go out.

06:12.965 --> 06:14.195
Go.

06:14.195 --> 06:14.876
You are sober.

06:14.876 --> 06:16.355
Don't go out.

06:17.635 --> 06:18.915
Go.

06:20.195 --> 06:21.075
Come on.

06:21.075 --> 06:22.235
Be careful.

06:22.235 --> 06:23.235
Cups in it.

06:23.235 --> 06:24.631
Don't break them.

06:27.675 --> 06:29.155
Well, give me.

06:29.525 --> 06:30.261
Bye.

06:30.285 --> 06:31.565
You...

06:32.045 --> 06:34.377
Take care.

06:34.435 --> 06:35.605
Send a message when at home.

06:35.605 --> 06:37.525
OK, I'll inform others in the group.

06:37.525 --> 06:37.876
Go back.

06:37.876 --> 06:39.416
Wish you a safe trip.

07:24.115 --> 07:25.395
Good.

07:25.845 --> 07:27.649
Ma has cheered up.

07:28.675 --> 07:30.107
That's good.

07:37.405 --> 07:38.981
I'm upset.

07:43.075 --> 07:44.615
I can't write a song.

07:47.075 --> 07:48.735
I can't write a script.

07:50.365 --> 07:51.645
Or...

07:52.235 --> 07:54.015
Shall we rent land?

07:56.755 --> 07:58.035
What to plant?

07:58.925 --> 08:00.205
Plant what?

08:01.525 --> 08:02.825
What's your idea?

08:04.075 --> 08:05.355
Flowers.

08:06.405 --> 08:07.685
What flowers?

08:09.045 --> 08:12.013
The flowers that help everything goes well.

08:13.405 --> 08:14.685
And you?

08:16.285 --> 08:17.565
I...

08:20.365 --> 08:21.989
Plant the sun.

08:22.845 --> 08:24.709
Plant the sun?

08:25.885 --> 08:28.133
♫ The sun ♫

08:28.165 --> 08:30.261
♫ brings us ♫

08:30.285 --> 08:34.501
♫ seven colors of light. ♫

08:34.525 --> 08:38.435
♫ It shines the flowers of our hearts. ♫

08:38.435 --> 08:42.531
♫ Beautiful and cute. ♫

08:42.555 --> 08:46.245
♫ Today, we grow up in the sun. ♫

08:46.245 --> 08:47.125
♫ Tomorrow, we will ♫

08:47.125 --> 08:49.835
♫ create a beautiful world. ♫

08:49.835 --> 08:51.675
♫ Come on. ♫

08:51.675 --> 08:53.743
♫ Come on. ♫

08:54.805 --> 08:56.177
Is that song?

08:58.475 --> 08:59.755
Maybe not.

09:00.355 --> 09:01.635
It's OK.

09:02.955 --> 09:06.885
♫ Come on. ♫

09:06.885 --> 09:10.645
♫ Come on. ♫

09:10.645 --> 09:12.595
♫ Seven colors of light ♫

09:12.595 --> 09:14.555
♫ is the sunshine. ♫

09:14.555 --> 09:16.555
♫ We walk into the future ♫

09:16.555 --> 09:18.765
♫ with colorful dreams. ♫

09:18.765 --> 09:20.555
♫ Seven colors of light ♫

09:20.555 --> 09:26.547
♫ is the... sunshine. ♫

10:08.875 --> 10:09.925
You cooked the rice well.

10:09.925 --> 10:11.205
Why not eat?

10:12.075 --> 10:13.375
No appetite.

10:15.595 --> 10:16.875
You won't eat?

10:21.285 --> 10:22.565
Wasteful.

10:23.805 --> 10:25.835
Grannies said that after death, people should

10:25.835 --> 10:28.623
eat all wasted food
before they can be reborn.

10:30.165 --> 10:31.501
Thank you.

10:39.125 --> 10:40.405
What's wrong?

10:43.595 --> 10:45.327
I'm just thinking about

10:45.555 --> 10:47.659
how to help my friend.

10:47.715 --> 10:48.555
You have money.

10:48.555 --> 10:49.835
Lend some.

10:50.075 --> 10:51.315
Superficial.

10:51.315 --> 10:54.583
This is not a matter
of money, but of work.

10:55.405 --> 10:56.685
She...

10:57.475 --> 10:59.819
She is not confident.

10:59.925 --> 11:01.025
Encourage her.

11:01.025 --> 11:02.305
Cheer her up.

11:03.075 --> 11:04.807
Eat your leftovers.

11:09.805 --> 11:13.335
When I studied wood carving,
master always scolded me

11:13.335 --> 11:14.635
for my poor work.

11:15.285 --> 11:17.821
I wanted to give up then.

11:18.285 --> 11:22.405
But once, I overheard him scolding the junior
fellow apprentices.

11:22.525 --> 11:25.445
Master said you shouldn't learn from Xiaxia.

11:25.675 --> 11:26.955
He is lazy,

11:27.045 --> 11:30.325
but he is quick-witted, skillful and
easy to teach.

11:30.955 --> 11:33.635
I was very happy.

11:34.555 --> 11:37.535
You just like to hear your master praise you.

11:37.645 --> 11:38.675
No.

11:38.675 --> 11:40.955
I think she needs positive encouragement.

11:40.955 --> 11:42.723
I did that.

11:42.835 --> 11:45.767
I told her she is great.

11:46.475 --> 11:50.981
However, there seems to
be no big incentive effect.

11:51.005 --> 11:53.505
Maybe she thinks it's just etiquette.

11:54.075 --> 11:55.355
No.

11:55.925 --> 11:57.205
I'm sincere.

12:06.285 --> 12:10.045
Well... Shall I repeat
it to her several times,

12:10.045 --> 12:12.137
just like brainwashing?

12:23.805 --> 12:25.685
[I'm revising the manuscript. You eat first.]

12:25.685 --> 12:28.525
[You've done very well. Don't push yourself
hard. Eat some first.]

12:28.525 --> 12:29.805
Failed.

12:30.165 --> 12:31.195
Damai is revising.

12:31.195 --> 12:32.475
She won't eat.

12:33.165 --> 12:34.195
What happened?

12:34.195 --> 12:36.647
She usually eats most actively.

12:38.525 --> 12:40.041
I cooked too much.

12:40.405 --> 12:42.317
Or... ask Mr. Hu to come.

12:42.355 --> 12:43.635
OK.

12:49.835 --> 12:51.123
Mr. Hu.

12:53.125 --> 12:54.405
Mr. Hu.

12:59.835 --> 13:01.615
Why not eat rice noodles?

13:15.315 --> 13:18.165
Hu said he won't eat on WeChat. He's gone to
bed.

13:18.165 --> 13:20.355
But he's usually the noisiest.

13:20.355 --> 13:21.635
Strange.

13:21.715 --> 13:22.835
Listen.

13:22.835 --> 13:25.885
Sometimes the mood of
the artist fluctuates greatly.

13:25.885 --> 13:29.245
When I came back, I saw
Damai and Hu sitting there,

13:29.245 --> 13:32.237
being at their wit's
end, not very energetic.

13:36.195 --> 13:38.839
I cooked too much. It's wasteful.

13:40.675 --> 13:43.835
Let your fiance eat it.

13:44.765 --> 13:46.435
My fiance?

13:46.435 --> 13:49.259
Perhaps he's gone to bed.

13:50.645 --> 13:54.005
I find that you have a great advantage.

13:54.005 --> 13:55.075
What?

13:55.075 --> 13:57.179
You can take jokes easily.

13:58.165 --> 14:00.435
Only the funny things are jokes.

14:00.435 --> 14:01.955
Others may not.

14:01.955 --> 14:05.355
The main reason is that
I have a high tolerance.

14:05.355 --> 14:07.135
I once worked in a hotel.

14:07.245 --> 14:10.261
No matter what the guest
says, you must accept it.

14:10.285 --> 14:13.397
You have to smile and be convinced.

14:16.405 --> 14:19.373
What if it is very serious?

14:19.835 --> 14:23.315
Such as defamation, slander
and damage to personal reputation.

14:23.315 --> 14:25.815
Let him be punished by law.

14:33.355 --> 14:35.475
Yao, what do you want to eat?

14:35.475 --> 14:37.015
I'll cook for you.

14:37.045 --> 14:39.437
It's too late. I don't want to eat.

14:39.765 --> 14:42.411
It's not OK.

14:42.435 --> 14:43.475
Granny.

14:43.475 --> 14:45.405
I'll cook some cake thread.

14:45.405 --> 14:48.531
And I cooked a lot of minced meat this morning.

14:48.555 --> 14:49.555
Add some.

14:49.555 --> 14:53.291
With two poached eggs, it'll be yummy.

14:53.315 --> 14:54.315
Granny.

14:54.315 --> 14:57.331
I forget to tell you there is no meat at home.

14:57.355 --> 14:58.925
No way.

14:58.925 --> 15:01.435
Half a pot left this morning.

15:01.435 --> 15:04.595
I took it to the Yard.

15:07.315 --> 15:09.221
You're so kind to her.

15:09.245 --> 15:10.773
Does she buy it?

15:11.525 --> 15:14.781
Xu Hongdou and I are just friends.

15:14.805 --> 15:16.897
Do I mean Hongdou?

15:20.285 --> 15:23.405
You... Go downstairs, OK?

15:23.405 --> 15:25.195
I'm busy writing the promotion plan.

15:25.195 --> 15:26.675
I'm going to cook.

15:26.675 --> 15:28.245
You must eat.

15:28.245 --> 15:29.581
Got it.

15:39.885 --> 15:42.565
[Gone to bed? Do you eat rice noodles?]

15:45.885 --> 15:48.709
Granny, you don't have to cook.

15:59.075 --> 16:02.501
Is the minced meat from my home?

16:02.525 --> 16:03.805
Yes.

16:04.315 --> 16:05.675
What did you cook?

16:06.595 --> 16:08.759
Rice noodles with cabbages.

16:09.315 --> 16:11.995
Well done, kitchen god!

16:12.355 --> 16:14.219
Just a joke.

16:15.715 --> 16:19.223
I have to say President
Xie is a good cook.

16:19.595 --> 16:21.327
Granny taught me that.

16:21.885 --> 16:26.473
Now she put too much salt, so I don't let
her cook.

16:27.405 --> 16:31.741
You said Mr. Hu is not in good spirits?

16:31.765 --> 16:32.835
A bit upset.

16:32.835 --> 16:34.555
Because of unemployment.

16:36.475 --> 16:37.755
Unemployment?

16:38.435 --> 16:40.765
The two restaurants where he sang were closed.

16:40.765 --> 16:43.825
Don't you notice that he hasn't gone out
these days?

16:43.835 --> 16:45.375
I don't think so.

16:45.525 --> 16:47.521
Two restaurants were closed?

16:51.195 --> 16:52.927
Did he see my dad?

16:54.595 --> 16:57.047
Xie's just been here for a few days.

16:57.145 --> 17:00.525
Apart from memorial day, he
collected potatoes at Feng's home

17:00.525 --> 17:03.595
and went around our stores
to inquire about business.

17:03.595 --> 17:06.695
Does he have time to discuss music with Mr. Hu?

17:07.155 --> 17:12.501
My father, according to the buzzword,
is a master of time management.

17:12.525 --> 17:14.377
Come on.

17:16.525 --> 17:17.805
No.

17:18.245 --> 17:20.075
What has it to do with your father?

17:20.075 --> 17:21.603
Very unusual.

17:21.685 --> 17:26.155
My father adored Mr. Hu when he
first knew that he was a musician.

17:26.155 --> 17:29.595
Of course, Hu was very happy, so
he told my father the songs he wrote

17:29.595 --> 17:31.915
and asked him for suggestions humbly.

17:31.915 --> 17:33.315
My father took it seriously.

17:33.315 --> 17:37.783
He let others listen in the market
and let them give their opinions.

17:38.155 --> 17:39.355
Then?

17:39.355 --> 17:42.285
Then, They made many suggestions.

17:42.285 --> 17:45.589
In a word, the songs are bad.

17:46.315 --> 17:48.045
No one thinks they're good?

17:48.045 --> 17:49.355
Some people like them.

17:49.355 --> 17:51.555
Since he asked for advice, they must
make some.

17:51.555 --> 17:55.205
For example, although the song
sounds good, the lyrics are poor.

17:55.205 --> 17:56.005
Just about love.

17:56.005 --> 17:56.685
Sentimental.

17:56.685 --> 17:57.965
Small pattern.

17:57.965 --> 18:01.205
If the business value is low,
it will be difficult to spread.

18:01.205 --> 18:03.155
It's better to learn to howl.

18:03.155 --> 18:04.875
Are they all so professional?

18:04.875 --> 18:06.395
Yes.

18:06.395 --> 18:09.805
As a result, my father is quite
superior when facing Mr. Hu.

18:09.805 --> 18:12.965
He always lectures him and asks him to learn
from Phoenix Legend.

18:12.965 --> 18:14.915
Why not persuade him?

18:14.915 --> 18:16.485
I did.

18:16.485 --> 18:19.395
But he said he wanted to let him make progress.

18:19.395 --> 18:21.979
Besides, Hu is very modest.

18:22.635 --> 18:26.803
First, he called him Mr. Hu
and later called him Hu.

18:40.835 --> 18:42.075
OK. Cut.

18:42.075 --> 18:42.685
Cut.

18:42.685 --> 18:43.965
Well done.

18:45.635 --> 18:47.575
My face freezes with a smile.

18:47.575 --> 18:48.286
This one is good.

18:48.286 --> 18:52.165
Your smile is good, but there's a small problem.

18:52.525 --> 18:54.981
Those grannies are a bit embarrassing.

18:55.005 --> 18:58.885
Can you communicate with
them and let them sit backward?

18:59.155 --> 19:00.587
OK, I will.

19:00.635 --> 19:01.915
Wait.

19:04.835 --> 19:07.383
Hi, grannies.

19:07.875 --> 19:09.155
Damai.

19:09.625 --> 19:10.355
Have water.

19:10.355 --> 19:11.595
OK.

19:11.595 --> 19:12.875
Tired?

19:12.875 --> 19:13.686
No.

19:13.686 --> 19:15.597
I've been sitting here.

19:16.075 --> 19:17.805
I told you filming is very interesting.

19:17.805 --> 19:19.115
It's true.

19:19.115 --> 19:20.395
Meaningful.

19:20.555 --> 19:24.525
I think it's very hard to go here and there.

19:24.525 --> 19:26.045
It's not hard at all.

19:26.045 --> 19:27.657
It's like a holiday.

19:27.685 --> 19:29.075
When I just graduated,

19:29.075 --> 19:31.635
I went to Guizhou with a crew to shoot
a documentary.

19:31.635 --> 19:33.595
The mountain road was difficult to walk.

19:33.595 --> 19:35.075
Cars couldn't enter.

19:35.115 --> 19:38.287
Sometimes I followed
those who carried machines.

19:39.075 --> 19:40.519
Good job.

19:40.805 --> 19:42.765
They all do. You can't quit.

19:44.315 --> 19:47.715
I think Xinxin is great.

19:47.875 --> 19:49.635
I was on a debate team in college.

19:49.635 --> 19:51.285
She was two grades below me.

19:51.285 --> 19:54.355
In the debate, she
fully showed her ability.

19:54.355 --> 19:58.151
She looked cute but was quite aggressive.

19:58.525 --> 20:01.001
She's really great.

20:01.395 --> 20:04.331
Not just that.

20:04.355 --> 20:09.115
Xinxin was a girl who
stuttered when talking to others.

20:09.115 --> 20:12.981
She sometimes cried
in anger when in a hurry.

20:13.005 --> 20:16.885
She joined the debate
team to change herself.

20:17.355 --> 20:19.855
Huang Xinxin stuttered before?

20:20.445 --> 20:22.165
How did she change that?

20:22.725 --> 20:24.155
A lot of practice.

20:24.155 --> 20:26.965
She looked in the mirror
every day and told herself

20:26.965 --> 20:30.353
she is excellent, she can, she will.

20:31.555 --> 20:33.661
Too mysterious.

20:33.685 --> 20:36.005
This is the power of faith.

20:36.005 --> 20:41.085
Everything will change when you
believe you can change everything.

20:41.355 --> 20:42.883
You can have a try.

20:44.245 --> 20:45.006
Thanks. Bye-bye.

20:45.006 --> 20:46.665
Thanks.

20:47.395 --> 20:49.525
Sunzi, I make it!

20:49.525 --> 20:51.075
OK. Let's shoot once more.

20:51.075 --> 20:51.806
Once more.

20:51.806 --> 20:53.245
Smile happily.

20:53.245 --> 20:54.285
Be contagious.

20:54.285 --> 20:55.315
OK. Happy.

20:55.315 --> 20:56.759
Like the last time.

20:56.875 --> 20:58.155
Come on.

20:59.045 --> 21:00.945
Jiahui, you behave well.

21:12.485 --> 21:13.765
Mr. Hu.

21:16.875 --> 21:18.485
Mr. Hu, are you inside?

21:18.485 --> 21:20.115
Who?

21:20.115 --> 21:21.005
I'm Xiaochun.

21:21.005 --> 21:23.301
Why not answer my call?

21:23.835 --> 21:24.765
Xiaochun?

21:24.765 --> 21:25.525
Open the door.

21:25.525 --> 21:27.869
My phone is muted.

21:32.525 --> 21:34.155
What's wrong with you?

21:34.155 --> 21:36.535
I just woke up. Haven't cleaned up.

21:38.115 --> 21:39.395
What?

21:40.685 --> 21:42.725
Please do me a favor.

21:42.725 --> 21:43.246
Say.

21:43.246 --> 21:47.045
The accordion teacher
of Hulu's kindergarten left.

21:47.045 --> 21:49.315
The children sing without accompaniment.

21:49.315 --> 21:52.439
I want you to have two music classes.

21:54.115 --> 21:55.725
I can't play the accordion.

21:55.725 --> 21:56.765
It doesn't matter.

21:56.765 --> 21:58.395
They have an electronic organ.

21:58.395 --> 21:59.875
I can.

22:00.525 --> 22:02.245
But I can't teach children.

22:02.245 --> 22:03.076
Look for others.

22:03.076 --> 22:05.005
Who else can help?

22:05.005 --> 22:07.875
I only know one professional singer,
that is you.

22:07.875 --> 22:09.155
It's easy to teach children.

22:09.155 --> 22:10.595
You sing and they learn.

22:10.595 --> 22:12.027
That's enough.

22:14.115 --> 22:16.555
No.

22:17.965 --> 22:18.805
You must.

22:18.805 --> 22:20.835
Take a bath and change your clothes.

22:20.835 --> 22:21.765
Clean up.

22:21.765 --> 22:22.316
Remember.

22:22.316 --> 22:24.623
Don't wear fancy clothes.

22:24.805 --> 22:27.811
Don't let the children smell tobacco
and alcohol.

22:27.835 --> 22:29.875
I have promised.

22:29.875 --> 22:32.395
Prepare a children's song.

22:32.395 --> 22:34.235
On time for class at 2:30.

22:35.525 --> 22:37.377
No. Bye.

22:37.915 --> 22:39.835
On time for class at 2:30.

22:39.835 --> 22:41.115
See you soon.

22:41.115 --> 22:41.725
Xiaochun.

22:41.725 --> 22:42.486
2:30.

22:42.486 --> 22:43.485
No, I can't.

22:43.485 --> 22:44.765
2:30.

22:51.835 --> 22:53.567
What a day!

22:58.395 --> 22:59.635
Hello, everyone!

22:59.635 --> 23:02.395
This is Mr. Hu who is to
give us a music lesson today.

23:02.395 --> 23:04.005
Everybody, come on.

23:04.005 --> 23:05.725
Hello, Mr. Hu.

23:05.725 --> 23:10.851
Hello, Mr. Hu.

23:10.875 --> 23:11.636
Hello.

23:11.636 --> 23:12.915
Clap your hands.

23:12.915 --> 23:19.725
Welcome Mr. Hu.

23:19.725 --> 23:21.385
What song is ready?

23:21.525 --> 23:22.445
Seven Colors of Light.

23:22.445 --> 23:23.635
Have they learned it?

23:23.635 --> 23:24.555
No.

23:24.555 --> 23:25.875
Is it OK?

23:25.875 --> 23:26.595
OK.

23:26.595 --> 23:27.076
Just it.

23:27.076 --> 23:28.635
Sing for them first.

23:28.635 --> 23:30.005
Sing first?

23:30.005 --> 23:31.685
Do you want to hear Mr. Hu sing?

23:31.685 --> 23:33.595
Yes!

23:33.595 --> 23:36.143
Clap your hands! Encourage him.

23:37.005 --> 23:39.193
I'll have a try.

23:52.965 --> 23:54.965
♫ The sun ♫

23:54.965 --> 24:01.701
♫ brings us seven colors of light. ♫

24:01.725 --> 24:06.115
♫ It shines the flowers of our hearts. ♫

24:06.115 --> 24:10.199
♫ Beautiful and cute. ♫

24:10.445 --> 24:14.765
♫ Today, we grow up in the sun. ♫

24:14.765 --> 24:16.965
♫ Tomorrow, we will ♫

24:16.965 --> 24:19.245
♫ create a beautiful world. ♫

24:19.245 --> 24:21.285
♫ Come on. ♫

24:21.285 --> 24:23.555
♫ Come on. ♫

24:23.555 --> 24:25.635
♫ Come on. ♫

24:25.635 --> 24:27.915
♫ Come on. ♫

24:27.915 --> 24:30.115
♫ Seven colors of light ♫

24:30.115 --> 24:32.355
♫ is the sunshine. ♫

24:32.355 --> 24:34.525
♫ We walk into the future ♫

24:34.525 --> 24:39.065
♫ with colorful dreams. ♫

24:41.315 --> 24:42.915
Is the song beautiful?

24:42.915 --> 24:45.765
Yes!

24:45.765 --> 24:47.617
Clap your hands.

24:48.555 --> 24:50.131
Thank you.

25:00.445 --> 25:01.685
Do you know?

25:01.685 --> 25:08.765
In the promo, Damai arranged
a scene for you and your fiance.

25:08.765 --> 25:10.045
What scene?

25:11.075 --> 25:15.159
Taking a horse for a walk
at the seaside in the sunset.

25:16.395 --> 25:22.387
That's more romantic than
spraying water in the sun.

25:23.685 --> 25:25.441
What's your scene?

25:25.905 --> 25:27.185
I won't show up.

25:27.915 --> 25:29.743
But our yard will appear.

25:30.155 --> 25:33.005
I've told Junzi my face won't appear.

25:33.005 --> 25:34.915
It only includes my back and tea making.

25:34.915 --> 25:36.155
No.

25:36.155 --> 25:37.539
Sunzi.

25:38.395 --> 25:39.675
Sunzi.

25:40.245 --> 25:44.305
Why is her name Sunzi?

25:44.305 --> 25:46.685
It's said that her mother is Zhuzi.

25:46.765 --> 25:49.349
Zhuzi? No wonder.

25:54.685 --> 25:55.965
Done.

25:56.725 --> 25:58.005
Look.

26:00.315 --> 26:01.595
Is it OK?

26:02.805 --> 26:05.617
Great.

26:05.875 --> 26:07.155
I'll send it.

26:13.965 --> 26:16.201
Hello, mom.

26:16.395 --> 26:18.891
Dou, you sent so many hams again.

26:18.915 --> 26:20.683
Your dad can't carry it.

26:21.555 --> 26:24.805
I sent two pieces last time and you
considered it delicious.

26:24.805 --> 26:27.115
It was pickled by relatives of a friend.

26:27.115 --> 26:30.155
Give some to aunts.

26:30.155 --> 26:31.455
Good.

26:32.245 --> 26:33.905
What are you doing now?

26:33.965 --> 26:36.873
I'm basking in the sun in the yard.

26:37.445 --> 26:38.206
Fourth aunt.

26:38.206 --> 26:41.245
In your thirties, you're
just like your grandmother.

26:41.245 --> 26:43.061
Basking in the sun?

26:43.765 --> 26:45.155
How about the new home?

26:45.155 --> 26:46.575
When will you move?

26:46.635 --> 26:47.915
I've finished.

26:47.915 --> 26:50.891
I'm thinking that you'll
come back to move

26:50.915 --> 26:52.245
one month later.

26:52.245 --> 26:54.765
Tidy up the things in your room.

26:54.765 --> 26:57.635
I don't know what you want to keep or
throw away.

26:57.635 --> 26:58.555
OK.

26:58.555 --> 26:59.285
Well.

26:59.285 --> 27:01.115
Don't buy more things.

27:01.115 --> 27:02.395
Got it.

27:03.485 --> 27:05.097
The knife won't cut.

27:05.355 --> 27:07.811
The cleaver doesn't work, either.

27:07.835 --> 27:10.479
Why not borrow one from the neighbor?

27:10.685 --> 27:11.555
OK.

27:11.555 --> 27:11.915
Dou.

27:11.915 --> 27:12.686
I have to hang up.

27:12.686 --> 27:15.209
Your dad and I will try to cut ham.

27:16.005 --> 27:17.485
That's all, mom and dad.

27:17.485 --> 27:18.765
Bye.

27:21.725 --> 27:26.555
Honey, I think she's very
happy when she calls recently.

27:26.555 --> 27:28.045
I dare not say before.

27:28.045 --> 27:30.965
I thought Dou was deathly still.

27:30.965 --> 27:32.555
Whatever she did, she had no spirit.

27:32.555 --> 27:33.725
Deathly still?

27:33.725 --> 27:34.635
Can you speak?

27:34.635 --> 27:36.005
If not, shut up.

27:36.005 --> 27:37.315
It's just an adjective.

27:37.315 --> 27:39.075
I don't want to hear such adjectives.

27:39.075 --> 27:40.555
What the hell!

27:40.805 --> 27:42.245
I'm not good at speech.

27:42.245 --> 27:43.857
Don't be angry.

27:45.485 --> 27:46.765
Where to go?

27:47.485 --> 27:49.049
To borrow a knife.

27:50.555 --> 27:54.501
When you're angry,
you're not cute at all.

27:54.525 --> 27:55.635
So you're cute?

27:55.635 --> 27:56.765
You're Cute Xu.

27:56.765 --> 27:57.835
Yes, I'm Cute Xu.

27:57.835 --> 28:01.427
I'm going to borrow a knife by motorcycle.

28:03.765 --> 28:05.149
They are moving?

28:06.225 --> 28:07.485
My sister bought them a house.

28:07.485 --> 28:09.325
I paid the decoration fee.

28:10.115 --> 28:12.459
It's good to raise daughters.

28:13.045 --> 28:14.205
Yes.

28:14.205 --> 28:15.915
Girls are golden flowers.

28:15.915 --> 28:17.155
Nana, which boy do you like?

28:17.155 --> 28:18.285
Tell me.

28:18.285 --> 28:21.805
I'll take him to you at the next
Double Third Festival.

28:22.395 --> 28:25.765
Granny, you only care about
me instead of Hongdou?

28:25.765 --> 28:28.193
Hongdou has Yao already.

28:30.155 --> 28:32.031
Hongdou.

28:32.155 --> 28:36.767
There is no man with better
character and appearance than Yao.

28:37.555 --> 28:38.525
Granny.

28:38.525 --> 28:41.181
Yao and I are just friends.

28:41.205 --> 28:42.115
I'll leave soon.

28:42.115 --> 28:45.035
Introduce a suitable girl to him.

28:46.045 --> 28:47.657
You don't want him?

28:50.765 --> 28:54.489
Even if you ask me 100
times, I will still say that

28:54.835 --> 28:56.525
I am not in love with him.

28:56.525 --> 28:58.041
Just out of work.

28:59.115 --> 29:01.951
Yao really likes you.

29:02.805 --> 29:04.315
Granny Xiuying.

29:04.315 --> 29:05.685
Don't be upset.

29:05.685 --> 29:08.701
Though Hongdou will leave, I won't.

29:08.915 --> 29:11.079
How about me?

29:11.285 --> 29:12.765
You're also pretty.

29:12.765 --> 29:13.635
Yes.

29:13.635 --> 29:15.781
Can I find a boy?

29:15.805 --> 29:17.765
How about Xiaxia?

29:19.725 --> 29:20.835
Xiaxia?

29:20.835 --> 29:24.343
He's just a little boy.

29:24.915 --> 29:29.371
I like mature men like President Xie.

29:29.395 --> 29:31.115
Like me?

29:31.555 --> 29:32.156
President Xie.

29:32.156 --> 29:33.695
Why are you here?

29:33.835 --> 29:35.005
I saw sour papaya.

29:35.005 --> 29:36.305
So I bought some.

29:36.395 --> 29:37.725
What did you say?

29:37.725 --> 29:42.355
I told Granny Xiuying I
like mature men like you.

29:42.355 --> 29:43.883
You have good taste.

29:44.005 --> 29:45.115
Granny, sour papaya.

29:45.115 --> 29:46.415
No, thanks.

29:47.395 --> 29:49.685
Nana, do you have iced tea?

29:49.685 --> 29:50.965
Yes.

29:59.205 --> 30:01.115
Have you ever eaten sour papaya?

30:01.115 --> 30:01.915
No.

30:01.915 --> 30:03.005
Try it.

30:03.005 --> 30:04.045
Sour?

30:04.045 --> 30:05.325
I'll know.

30:12.315 --> 30:13.595
Thanks.

30:25.915 --> 30:27.347
Particularly sour.

30:27.425 --> 30:28.705
Is it sour?

30:29.035 --> 30:30.315
Just so so.

30:30.445 --> 30:31.865
You like sour food.

30:34.605 --> 30:36.505
You're the girl of vinegar.

30:38.285 --> 30:39.565
What?

30:40.555 --> 30:41.835
It's nonsense.

30:50.315 --> 30:52.485
When the rain stopped,
Zeqing went up the mountain

30:52.485 --> 30:54.769
and collected a lot of fungi.

30:55.075 --> 30:57.155
We're going to Qingdao.

30:57.155 --> 31:01.045
I'm going to fry more
fimbria for Yang and Xi.

31:01.045 --> 31:03.245
Here you are. One packet for each.

31:03.245 --> 31:03.915
OK.

31:03.915 --> 31:04.525
Is it enough?

31:04.525 --> 31:05.155
Yes.

31:05.155 --> 31:06.285
It's enough.

31:06.285 --> 31:08.545
Who will take charge of the Yard?

31:09.075 --> 31:10.595
I've discussed this with Feng.

31:10.595 --> 31:14.525
During my time in Qingdao,
Feng is responsible for sanitation.

31:14.525 --> 31:16.285
Later, she'll come to the Yard.

31:16.285 --> 31:17.685
I'll teach her.

31:17.685 --> 31:19.837
It's very complex.

31:20.285 --> 31:24.165
I'll pay her 50 yuan each day.

31:24.685 --> 31:25.445
Well.

31:25.445 --> 31:26.685
I'm going to see Feng.

31:26.685 --> 31:27.965
OK.

31:31.285 --> 31:33.851
The third one is sapphire.

31:33.875 --> 31:39.005
For some reason, it reminds
me of the star sign of March.

31:39.005 --> 31:40.635
Pisces.

31:40.635 --> 31:41.915
Feng.

31:42.525 --> 31:43.725
Chuchu.

31:43.725 --> 31:44.875
Aunt Gui is here.

31:44.875 --> 31:45.965
Yue.

31:45.965 --> 31:47.525
Do me a favor.

31:47.525 --> 31:47.966
Water?

31:47.966 --> 31:48.805
I'll offer some.

31:48.805 --> 31:49.725
No, thanks.

31:49.725 --> 31:51.005
Not thirsty.

31:51.595 --> 31:54.619
Why do you come specially?

31:54.635 --> 31:56.045
We're not off duty.

31:56.045 --> 31:57.369
I know.

31:57.875 --> 32:00.595
Zeqing went up the mountain to collect
some fungus.

32:00.595 --> 32:02.411
I'm here to share.

32:04.875 --> 32:05.285
For you.

32:05.285 --> 32:06.075
Thanks.

32:06.075 --> 32:06.635
Yours.

32:06.635 --> 32:07.835
Great!

32:07.835 --> 32:10.331
I can cook for my granny tonight.

32:10.355 --> 32:11.835
Is it fresh?

32:11.835 --> 32:12.525
Yes.

32:12.525 --> 32:16.441
Hotels outside are
buying it at a high price.

32:16.555 --> 32:18.445
But I don't care about that money.

32:18.445 --> 32:19.285
Yes.

32:19.285 --> 32:21.115
Eat when it's fresh.

32:21.115 --> 32:23.395
Cook with some ham. Yummy.

32:23.395 --> 32:27.245
Did Yang and Xi send you
red packets on your birthday?

32:27.245 --> 32:29.355
Not only on my birthday.

32:29.355 --> 32:32.323
I receive red packets every festival.

32:33.005 --> 32:37.797
Zeqing and I can't spend all that money.

32:38.875 --> 32:40.115
Fine.

32:40.115 --> 32:41.685
The money is for my granddaughter.

32:41.685 --> 32:42.725
Right?

32:42.725 --> 32:44.555
You're lucky.

32:44.555 --> 32:45.835
Of course.

32:46.355 --> 32:47.635
Feng.

32:48.905 --> 32:50.185
Come on.

32:51.395 --> 32:52.983
Two for you.

32:56.315 --> 32:58.455
Much thelephora ganbajun in it.

32:59.525 --> 33:00.635
I have to go.

33:00.635 --> 33:01.725
See you in the Yard.

33:01.725 --> 33:03.525
Come when you're off duty.

33:03.525 --> 33:04.805
Got it.

33:04.805 --> 33:06.005
Aunt, take care.

33:06.005 --> 33:06.635
OK.

33:06.635 --> 33:08.445
I'm going to see Hongdou.

33:08.445 --> 33:09.445
Take care.

33:09.445 --> 33:10.725
See you.

33:14.445 --> 33:16.933
Yue, Chuchu.

33:17.205 --> 33:19.555
Take the fungus back.

33:19.555 --> 33:21.239
Chang and I don't eat.

33:21.915 --> 33:23.299
You don't eat?

33:23.945 --> 33:25.605
Not used to the flavor.

33:27.555 --> 33:28.835
Take it.

33:48.685 --> 33:50.441
We think

33:50.555 --> 33:54.725
since Yang and his wife
are busy, I can go to Qingdao

33:54.725 --> 33:57.009
to take care of their child.

33:57.045 --> 33:58.075
It's OK.

33:58.075 --> 34:01.005
Before she goes to
kindergarten, I can take her back

34:01.005 --> 34:03.349
and look after her, right?

34:04.085 --> 34:06.237
But Yang disagreed.

34:06.285 --> 34:09.315
He said that you have worked hard all your life.

34:09.315 --> 34:10.805
Don't work anymore.

34:10.805 --> 34:13.521
You should have a good rest.

34:14.205 --> 34:15.817
Yang is really filial.

34:16.515 --> 34:16.685
Yes.

34:16.685 --> 34:17.395
Aunt Gui.

34:17.395 --> 34:18.875
Are you sure these are not toxic?

34:18.875 --> 34:19.955
Not toxic.

34:19.955 --> 34:22.263
Xi is more filial.

34:23.085 --> 34:25.395
Xi scolded her brother some time ago.

34:25.395 --> 34:27.891
She said he doesn't often call me.

34:27.915 --> 34:31.999
Xi calls me every day.

34:32.355 --> 34:36.245
How often do you call your parents?

34:36.245 --> 34:38.049
Is it lurid bolete?

34:38.165 --> 34:38.995
Yes.

34:38.995 --> 34:40.565
This will take a long time to fry.

34:40.565 --> 34:41.835
A long time.

34:41.835 --> 34:44.011
Well... What's this?

34:44.035 --> 34:45.395
Nana.

34:45.395 --> 34:47.799
I'm chatting with Hongdou.

34:49.995 --> 34:52.781
Well, these are not toxic.

34:52.805 --> 34:55.293
I'll handle the fungi.

34:55.685 --> 34:56.605
Hongdou.

34:56.605 --> 34:59.033
How often do you call your mom?

34:59.515 --> 35:00.915
Every few days.

35:00.915 --> 35:02.875
I don't have much to say.

35:04.915 --> 35:07.515
You have no time to
call when you are busy.

35:07.515 --> 35:09.285
You don't call when free.

35:09.285 --> 35:11.041
When will you call?

35:11.245 --> 35:13.481
Will you call in an emergency?

35:14.315 --> 35:16.035
You'll be less close.

35:16.355 --> 35:17.435
Yes.

35:17.435 --> 35:18.715
Yes.

35:21.035 --> 35:22.605
I'm going to Qingdao.

35:22.605 --> 35:24.901
I'm going to eat seafood.

35:25.395 --> 35:26.205
Do you want water?

35:26.205 --> 35:27.485
No, thanks.

35:28.565 --> 35:29.845
I think

35:30.035 --> 35:32.523
I'd better make more flower cakes.

35:32.725 --> 35:35.315
Ask Aunt Baoping to make more milk fans

35:35.315 --> 35:39.475
for all the leaders and
colleagues of Yang and Xi to taste.

35:39.475 --> 35:41.927
Make some ham rice dumplings.

35:42.685 --> 35:45.017
Since Huang is going to film,

35:45.805 --> 35:47.205
you can make rice dumplings.

35:47.205 --> 35:48.485
Show your face.

35:49.475 --> 35:50.955
I have a role.

35:51.205 --> 35:52.485
Really?

35:53.125 --> 35:54.605
Great!

35:55.165 --> 35:57.805
When it's finished,
send it to your parents.

35:57.805 --> 35:59.369
It's an honor.

35:59.475 --> 36:00.725
Listen.

36:00.725 --> 36:04.085
I told Xi I'll be an actress.

36:04.085 --> 36:06.245
She didn't believe that.

36:06.245 --> 36:07.525
Disbelief.

36:08.805 --> 36:09.476
Look.

36:09.476 --> 36:13.691
I'll send the film to her
so that she'll believe.

36:14.645 --> 36:17.245
I didn't expect I could be an actress.

36:17.245 --> 36:18.125
Yes.

36:18.125 --> 36:18.915
Yes.

36:18.915 --> 36:20.205
Show up in the film.

36:20.205 --> 36:21.505
Show up together.

36:40.395 --> 36:41.565
Friends in the live room.

36:41.565 --> 36:42.355
Excuse me.

36:42.355 --> 36:43.765
You can watch it. But no photo.

36:43.765 --> 36:44.645
Excuse me.

36:44.645 --> 36:46.565
No photo is allowed.

36:46.565 --> 36:47.645
Don't run around.

36:47.645 --> 36:48.925
Thank you.

36:50.305 --> 36:57.605
♫ Honored guests come from afar ♫

36:59.805 --> 37:03.685
♫ Greeting guests with smiles ♫

37:06.005 --> 37:09.645
♫ Pick the living spring of East Mountain ♫

37:12.305 --> 37:15.405
♫ Select the best tea
and transport it to Xishan ♫

37:15.405 --> 37:18.925
♫ Walnuts and milk fans are sweet ♫

37:21.505 --> 37:24.505
♫ Excellent pepper is very fresh ♫

37:24.505 --> 37:27.505
♫ Repeatedly clean the tray ♫

37:27.505 --> 37:30.605
♫ The teapot is sparkling ♫

37:30.605 --> 37:34.245
♫ Several tea cups glitter ♫

37:36.905 --> 37:41.505
♫ The figure passes through the cup ♫

37:41.505 --> 37:45.385
♫ Treat guests to three courses of tea ♫

37:47.505 --> 37:51.705
♫ Have a free day with friends and relatives ♫

37:51.705 --> 37:55.345
♫ The cup is small, but the friendship is deep ♫

37:58.205 --> 38:00.885
♫ The happiness of health is boundless ♫

38:02.995 --> 38:04.631
Stop.

38:04.805 --> 38:07.293
Nana, let's discuss this.

38:07.805 --> 38:09.465
Can you show your face?

38:11.245 --> 38:12.355
No.

38:12.355 --> 38:13.395
Why?

38:13.395 --> 38:14.971
Her face is nice.

38:15.685 --> 38:16.835
She's unwilling.

38:16.835 --> 38:18.515
And her hands are also nice.

38:18.515 --> 38:20.891
Natural and smooth.

38:20.915 --> 38:22.491
Yes, I'm unwilling.

38:23.605 --> 38:26.129
OK, let's take a new way.

38:27.915 --> 38:30.205
When you film, downwards.

38:30.205 --> 38:31.685
Yes. From the hand.

38:31.765 --> 38:33.045
Backward.

38:33.565 --> 38:34.937
Upwards.

38:34.995 --> 38:35.166
Yes.

38:35.166 --> 38:36.645
Be slow.

38:39.915 --> 38:41.839
Not good?

38:42.125 --> 38:45.081
You asked me to make them up.

38:45.435 --> 38:46.715
Good.

38:47.765 --> 38:48.725
Aunt Baoping.

38:48.725 --> 38:50.205
Take a photo for us.

38:50.245 --> 38:50.836
Together?

38:50.836 --> 38:52.315
Come on.

38:52.315 --> 38:53.355
Come to take a photo.

38:53.355 --> 38:54.515
Come on.

38:54.515 --> 38:55.355
Stand still.

38:55.355 --> 38:57.183
Look there.

38:57.315 --> 38:58.245
Go.

38:58.245 --> 39:00.433
1, 2, 3.

39:02.125 --> 39:03.405
OK.

39:07.285 --> 39:08.945
Wash your eyes.

39:09.475 --> 39:10.755
And rouge.

39:12.065 --> 39:12.955
Where are the other kids?

39:12.955 --> 39:13.725
Haven't come.

39:13.725 --> 39:15.005
Let me call.

39:16.245 --> 39:16.955
Use the soap.

39:16.955 --> 39:18.125
Wash with soap.

39:18.125 --> 39:20.853
Yao.

39:22.245 --> 39:22.995
Come on.

39:22.995 --> 39:23.435
Hurry up.

39:23.435 --> 39:24.035
Wash face.

39:24.035 --> 39:24.836
Wash your face.

39:24.836 --> 39:25.835
Get out of the way.

39:25.835 --> 39:26.205
Forward.

39:26.205 --> 39:27.485
Step aside.

39:47.645 --> 39:48.925
OK. Stop.

39:49.725 --> 39:51.245
Very good.

39:51.245 --> 39:52.036
Dear children.

39:52.036 --> 39:53.805
Once again, OK?

39:53.805 --> 39:54.955
Well done.

39:54.955 --> 39:55.805
Once again.

39:55.805 --> 39:56.685
OK. Go back.

39:56.685 --> 39:58.393
Great. Come on.

40:00.205 --> 40:01.355
Run once again.

40:01.355 --> 40:02.635
OK.

40:15.395 --> 40:17.403
When can we stop walking?

40:17.685 --> 40:21.169
Until Sunzi films what she wants.

40:23.235 --> 40:23.916
Don't look back.

40:23.916 --> 40:25.576
Don't look at the lens.

40:34.475 --> 40:37.359
Get closer.

40:38.035 --> 40:39.719
Have a chat.

40:42.285 --> 40:43.669
Hand in hand.

41:00.725 --> 41:02.805
Do whatever Sunzi asks you to do.

41:02.805 --> 41:04.345
Let's finish earlier.

41:06.985 --> 41:08.265
♫ The journey ♫

41:08.685 --> 41:11.785
♫ One step to stars ♫

41:11.785 --> 41:15.905
♫ One step to the rainbow ♫

41:16.385 --> 41:19.805
♫ We miss and hug ♫

41:19.805 --> 41:21.585
♫ In the world ♫

41:21.585 --> 41:24.985
♫ Where is the breeze ♫

41:24.985 --> 41:28.505
♫ Where is the heartbeat ♫

41:29.245 --> 41:29.646
Yes.

41:29.646 --> 41:31.173
That's it. Keep.

41:33.915 --> 41:34.915
Say something.

41:34.915 --> 41:36.685
Director asks us to chat.

41:36.685 --> 41:37.805
Where are your cold jokes?

41:37.805 --> 41:39.093
Hurry up.

41:39.645 --> 41:40.925
Cold jokes?

41:42.705 --> 41:46.605
♫ We just farewell ♫

41:46.605 --> 41:48.361
You didn't drink.

41:48.565 --> 41:50.045
Out of your mind?

41:50.515 --> 41:53.285
Too hot. Don't you think so?

41:53.285 --> 41:54.565
Hot?

41:56.355 --> 41:58.603
But your hands are sweaty.

42:00.205 --> 42:01.913
Arm in arm.

42:06.245 --> 42:07.525
Well.

42:07.725 --> 42:09.157
Ma called me.

42:09.685 --> 42:12.661
He is dutiful at home.

42:12.685 --> 42:15.181
He washes, mops and cooks.

42:15.205 --> 42:18.645
But his parents don't give him good comments.

42:18.645 --> 42:20.317
He dare not blame them.

42:21.245 --> 42:23.265
So he's not afraid of no one.

42:25.725 --> 42:27.125
♫ The flowers are blooming ♫

42:27.125 --> 42:31.285
Damai designs the scene
where lovers walk by the sea

42:31.285 --> 42:32.585
and lead a horse.

42:33.475 --> 42:34.955
She likes that.

42:35.075 --> 42:38.476
♫ Happy time ♫

42:43.735 --> 42:50.243
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

42:51.175 --> 42:57.059
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

42:58.585 --> 43:04.955
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:04.955 --> 43:11.355
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

43:13.295 --> 43:19.707
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:20.665 --> 43:26.441
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

43:28.095 --> 43:34.625
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

43:34.625 --> 43:41.997
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:42.905 --> 43:49.345
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

43:49.345 --> 43:57.345
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

43:57.475 --> 43:59.525
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

43:59.525 --> 44:04.155
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:04.155 --> 44:12.495
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

